  "caveats": [
    "Private bootstrap-admitted storage entry. No public factory, workflow, POM, limits, paid experiment or push change.",
    "Actual local phases at all six size/source profiles. Fresh workers receive paths and a new requested ballot, no fixture historical observation set.",
    "Four successive retirement halt/SIGKILL interruptions and recovery are process-death evidence, not power-loss durability or availability SLA.",
    "Cross-configuration pending-context turnover, incoming verified adoption, autonomous election ownership, learners/joint completion and full Phase 3 mapping remain open.",
    "The full 590-test Python normal/optimized run precedes only the final prepared-state negative fixture adjustment. That fixture has five final focused tests in both modes and exact original-first/optimized/portable negative replay; production Java inputs are identical to all 69 final Java tests.",
    "Intermediate ancestry failure, historical six-profile pass, canonical mutation encoding failure and malformed prepared-journal mutation remain separate retained attempts. Failed qualification is not counted as successful rejection."
  ],
